WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.702
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.503
We hope you're
doing well tonight

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.370
and now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.404
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:07.173
The Manhattan grand jury
investigating

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.909
former President Trump's
alleged involvement

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:11.244
in a hush money payment

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:13.980
is reportedly not expected
to hear any more evidence

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.048
for the next month.

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:17.316
Oh, you mean they need
some time off

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:19.886
after hearing nothing
but Trump sex stories?

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:21.054
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:22.921
"Please, we just we just --

00:00:22.921 --> 00:00:24.557
we just need a month!"

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.225
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:28.828
According to a new report,
several top Republican donors

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.863
are worried that Florida
Governor Ron DeSantis

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:33.499
does not have the charisma
for a national campaign.

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:35.835
This guy? This guy
doesn't have the charisma

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.570
for a local ad campaign.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.939
[ Laughter ]
He looks like a used car dealer

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.708
who insists on being
in the commercials.

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:44.476
[ As DeSantis ]
Come on down to Ron's motors.

00:00:44.476 --> 00:00:46.879
Our prices aren't woke

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:48.381
and that's no joke!

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.916
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:52.352
Republican Congressman
Mike Gallagher warned this week

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:55.020
that China wants to use
artificial intelligence

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.923
to perfect its
"Orwellian surveillance state."

00:00:57.923 --> 00:01:00.526
Unfortunately, Republicans
don't know what that means

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.262
because they banned that book.

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:04.664
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:07.199
Dr. Anthony Fauci has reportedly
sold his memoir

00:01:07.199 --> 00:01:09.002
for just under $5 million.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.870
He will not narrate
the audiobook, though,

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.338
because he knows no one
ever listens to him.

00:01:13.338 --> 00:01:15.508
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:17.376
Two fishermen
who allegedly cheated

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:19.712
in a competitive
fishing competition in Ohio

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.814
pleaded guilty this week
to criminal charges

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:23.749
and face up to one year
in prison.

00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:25.585
And do you know what they do
to people

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:27.954
who cheat at fishing, in prison?

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:28.988
Because I don't.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.456
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:33.159
I'm guessing it's literally
never happened before.

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:34.827
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.827 --> 00:01:36.362
A travel company has announced
it will offer

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:38.464
the world's longest bus journey
this summer,

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:41.400
which will take riders
on a 56-day trip across Europe

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.435
or, for a cheaper 56-day trip,

00:01:43.435 --> 00:01:45.204
book a Greyhound
to Jacksonville.

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:48.041
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.075 --> 00:01:53.679
I feel like one of our writers,
Bryan, did that once

00:01:53.679 --> 00:01:56.049
and thought maybe
the whole audience had as well.

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:59.085
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.085 --> 00:02:00.819
It was announced yesterday
that the sequel

00:02:00.819 --> 00:02:02.655
to author John Grisham's book
"The Firm"

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:03.989
will be released later
this year.

00:02:03.989 --> 00:02:05.491
This news first reported

00:02:05.491 --> 00:02:07.794
in an all-caps text
from your dad.

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:10.830
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.532
Today was baseball's
Opening Day,

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:14.833
with all 30 MLB teams
playing games,

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:16.569
and it's about 40° here
in New York,

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:18.738
so, if you're the Mets,
this is what it feels like

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:19.805
to play in October.

00:02:19.805 --> 00:02:22.675
[ Laughter and awws ]

00:02:24.476 --> 00:02:26.579
And, finally, the department
store chain Macy's

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:29.649
announced yesterday that its CEO
will retire next year,

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:31.751
while T.J.Maxx announced
their CEO

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.519
is just a loose pile of pants.

00:02:33.519 --> 00:02:34.954
[ Laughter ]
-And that --

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:36.155
that was a monologue, everybody.

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:37.590
[ Cheering and applause ]
We're off and running.

